{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"先落在左上方第一行大号标题，金色强调的“憋着气”“当作自己人”最醒目；随后下方两行同样醒目的大标题吸引视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他还憋着气，想起曾经被当作自己人；但完整的处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋气、短暂高兴；是否已经转为心酸，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"高兴尚未消退便转为心酸，以及旧日无法重来、离开后是否真的更好的疑问。上下两个标题共同构成的情绪变化不容易一次拿全。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大标题都很醒目，形成两个主视觉焦点。\",\n    \"核心情绪变化分散在两块标题里，需要拼接才能完整理解。\",\n    \"上方和下方的小字连续堆叠，需要在多条信息之间挑选。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "85b38374-bff8-41a0-b18d-2c40dae5f075", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T022155552935Z", "elapsed_seconds": 42.64, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:22:38.196211+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1a29e8965cc3c18852a3128a4288aa6e29d6334f77f619fa391a070f1df1e007", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachme